<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-month bill yield falls to 22.38 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-month bill yield falls to 22.38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.38 percent, down from 22.48 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     13,312.69 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.38 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.7152 pct</p>
</text>
